msgid "Back"
msgstr "返回"
msgid "Continue"
msgstr "继续"
msgid "Finish"
msgstr "完成"
msgid "A calm, capable desktop for your everyday work.\n\nThis setup takes a few moments and can be changed later in Settings."
msgstr "一个平静、可靠、适合日常工作的桌面。\n\n初始设置只需几分钟，之后也可以在系统设置中修改。"
msgid "Please review the Lingmo Aurora service agreement before continuing."
msgstr "请在继续之前阅读 Lingmo Aurora 服务协议。"
msgid "Lingmo Aurora Service Agreement"
msgstr "Lingmo Aurora 服务协议"
msgid "Effective date: 2026-11-01"
msgstr "生效日期：2026 年 11 月 1 日"
msgid "Lingmo Aurora Service Agreement\n\nBefore using Lingmo Aurora or any service provided with it, please read this agreement carefully. By installing or using the system, you agree to the terms and conditions described here.\n\nThe system may include third-party services and software. Their respective terms and notices remain available in Settings. You can review or change your preferences after setup."
msgstr "Lingmo Aurora 服务协议\n\n在使用 Lingmo Aurora 或随系统提供的任何服务前，请仔细阅读本协议。安装或使用系统即表示您同意此处所述的条款和条件。\n\n系统可能包含第三方服务和软件，其相应条款和声明可在系统设置中查看。完成设置后，您可以继续查看或修改相关偏好。"
msgid "I agree to the Lingmo Aurora service agreement"
msgstr "我同意 Lingmo Aurora 服务协议"
msgid "Select the keyboard layout you use most often. You can add more layouts later in Settings."
msgstr "选择您最常使用的键盘布局，之后可以在系统设置中添加更多布局。"
msgid "English (US)"
msgstr "英语（美国）"
msgid "QWERTY keyboard layout"
msgstr "QWERTY 键盘布局"
msgid "中文拼音"
msgstr "中文拼音"
msgid "Chinese Pinyin input"
msgstr "中文拼音输入"
msgid "Use network time to keep the system clock accurate."
msgstr "使用网络时间保持系统时钟准确。"
msgid "Current time zone: "
msgstr "当前时区："
msgid "Set time automatically"
msgstr "自动设置时间"
msgid "Network access can be configured from the status bar after setup. Your existing connections will remain available."
msgstr "完成设置后，可以从状态栏配置网络访问。现有连接会继续可用。"
msgid "Choose how Lingmo Aurora should look. You can change this later in Settings."
msgstr "选择 Lingmo Aurora 的外观，之后可以在系统设置中修改。"
msgid "Light appearance"
msgstr "浅色外观"
msgid "Bright surfaces with clear contrast"
msgstr "明亮表面与清晰对比度"
msgid "Dark appearance"
msgstr "深色外观"
msgid "A darker palette for dim environments"
msgstr "适合低光环境的深色配色"
msgid "Your basic preferences are ready. Select Finish to enter the Lingmo Aurora desktop."
msgstr "基本偏好已准备就绪。选择“完成”进入 Lingmo Aurora 桌面。"
msgid "Welcome to Lingmo Aurora"
msgstr "欢迎使用 Lingmo Aurora"
msgid "Service agreement"
msgstr "服务协议"
msgid "Keyboard layout"
msgstr "键盘布局"
msgid "Time & date"
msgstr "时间和日期"
msgid "Network access"
msgstr "网络访问"
msgid "Personalize your desktop"
msgstr "个性化桌面"
msgid "You're ready to go"
msgstr "准备就绪"
msgid "Let's get your new desktop ready."
msgstr "让我们准备好您的新桌面。"
msgid "Review the terms before continuing."
msgstr "请在继续前查看协议条款。"
msgid "Choose your primary input method."
msgstr "选择您的主要输入方式。"
msgid "Keep your clock in sync."
msgstr "保持系统时钟同步。"
msgid "Connect after you enter the desktop."
msgstr "进入桌面后连接网络。"
msgid "Choose a comfortable appearance."
msgstr "选择舒适的外观。"
msgid "Finish setup to start using Aurora."
msgstr "完成设置后开始使用 Aurora。"
msgid "Lingmo Aurora Initial Setup"
msgstr "Lingmo Aurora 初始设置"
msgid "First-run setup for Lingmo Aurora"
msgstr "Lingmo Aurora 初始设置"
